flowchart TD
    A[User chooses Start camera] --> B{Browser supports camera API?}
    B -- No --> E[Actionable message or simulated demo]
    B -- Yes --> C[Browser requests permission]
    C --> D{Permission granted?}
    D -- No --> E
    D -- Yes --> F[Display mirrored video]
    F --> G[Load local MediaPipe WASM and task bundle]
    G --> H{Model initialized?}
    H -- No --> I[Show model recovery message]
    I --> J[Continue with simulated mode or mouse/touch]
    H -- Yes --> K[Sample video frames at controlled cadence]
    K --> L[Detect up to two hands]
    L --> M[Return 21 image-space landmarks and handedness]
    M --> N[Classify fingertip geometry]
    N --> O[Require stable multi-frame gesture]
    M --> P[Adaptive low-pass smoothing]
    P --> Q[Mirror and aspect-ratio coordinate mapping]
    O --> R{Drawing enabled or stable pinch?}
    Q --> R
    R -- Yes --> S[Append fingertip sample to drawing item]
    R -- No --> T[Render cursor and safe pause state]
    S --> U[Independent artwork canvas]
